# Build konteksti repo ildizi (docker/Dockerfile.api) — faqat kerakli narsa image'ga kirsin.
#
# ⚠️ Wash'dan FARQI: bu yerda TAQIQ emas, RUXSAT ro'yxati (avval hammasi chiqariladi,
# keyin keraklisi qaytariladi). Sabab ikkita:
#   1) Repo'da hali ko'chirilmagan eski daraxtlar turibdi (`legacy/`, `wms-api/`,
#      `wms-ui/`, `wms-admin/`). Taqiq ro'yxatida bittasi unutilsa yuzlab MB kontekst,
#      eski `publish/` va ichida JWT kaliti bor eski `appsettings.Production.json`
#      image qatlamiga tushardi (PLATFORMA-TZ §7·F6.1 — «Git'da sir bor»).
#   2) Dockerfile.api `COPY . ./` qiladi, chunki `seed/` hali yo'q (F6.3 W2·6), lekin
#      `WMS.Infrastructure` uni EmbeddedResource sifatida kutadi. `COPY seed/` papka
#      paydo bo'lguncha build'ni yiqitardi; `!seed/` esa papka yo'q bo'lsa jim o'tadi.
#
# Dockerfile.web bu faylni O'QIMAYDI — yonidagi `docker/Dockerfile.web.dockerignore`
# undan ustun turadi (BuildKit qoidasi).
*

!AgenticsWms.slnx
!global.json
!nuget.config
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!.editorconfig
!src/
!seed/

**/bin/
**/obj/

# Tenant logolari ish vaqtida `wms-uploads` hajmiga yoziladi — dasturchi
# mashinasida yuklangan fayllar image'ga kirmasin.
src/WMS.API/wwwroot/uploads/
src/WMS.API/uploads/
